        "content": "<p>Visual Lean is an accessible web interface for writing verified Lean code. </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://leangame.io\">leangame.io</a></p>\n<p>Visual Lean is usable with only mouse or touchscreen: no keyboard is needed. You can play through the entire <a href=\"https://cbirkbeck.github.io/natural_number_game/\">Natural Numbers Game</a> this way. It runs in-browser on top of <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1001429\">@Cauli Ziani</span>'s <a href=\"https://github.com/cauli/lean4-wasm-in-browser\">WASM port of Lean 4</a>.</p>\n<p>Please give it a try, we'd love to hear your feedback!</p>\n<p><img alt=\"addition2-succ-case-3x.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"4095x2391\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/RJUGVKOSXworBxKNiDsSucyT/addition2-succ-case-3x.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/RJUGVKOSXworBxKNiDsSucyT/addition2-succ-case-3x.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\n<img alt=\"iphone-addition2-succ-case-short.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1179x2301\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/GWSbGonNo7NFGmS3NOA8J4D1/iphone-addition2-succ-case-short.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/GWSbGonNo7NFGmS3NOA8J4D1/iphone-addition2-succ-case-short.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
